{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "f23f7ab2bbc112f925182dcadae5bba01c863192c1f82b86b35ec024dee787bf", "ja": "待ちぼうけの終わり", "zh": "徒劳等待的终结", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a8cc5463c5c65c266f284f40712ac9e8d45316d1d1020f28807c23a3b94e9402", "ja": "公演後、メンバーと打ち上げ中のプロデュー\nサーにあずさから電話が。山で迷っていると\n聞き、慌てて迎えに行く。あずさは、ピッく\nんを探し出していた。泣いて再会を喜ぶ麗花\nに、誰もがもらい泣きするのだった。", "zh": "公演结束后，正在和成员们参加庆功宴的制作人接到了\n梓打来的电话。听说她在山里迷路了，便慌忙赶去接她。\n梓已经找到了小皮克。看到丽花哭着为重逢而高兴，\n所有人也都感动得跟着落泪了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "666e7c45b8634b52a3fce6ca032875793883cd90c7709e1f4e0f6c422067177b", "ja": "（天体公演が終わって、数日が経った。\nこれからアクアリウスのメンバーで打ち上げだ！）", "zh": "（天体公演结束后，已经过去几天了。接下来就是水瓶座成员们的庆功宴！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "162829301b9bcf18dbdac6468cee768b3fcd99b2c809a166f67878550fad6d87", "ja": "食べ放題だなんて、うれしいです！\n何にしようかな……たい焼き、あるといいな♪", "zh": "居然是自助餐，好开心啊！\n吃什么好呢……要是有鲷鱼烧就好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "f50bfc7467149a846ff01665daccb582b321276bcffe0672c04ca240cb9ffc61", "ja": "あたし、肉がいいな。いいだろ？\nやっぱライブの後は肉だぜ！", "zh": "我想吃肉。可以吧？\n果然演出结束后就该吃肉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "464cf2a5f4525bcbc953c5554f81bbb84ee392b673c155d6b58ede1217f7a8fb", "ja": "わーい♪　お肉、お肉♪\nナイストゥミートゥー！　トゥー！", "zh": "耶♪ 肉肉，肉肉♪  \n肉到你啦！肉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5a2a876676504885870bbf99ba9f52222f374e516d3b69067f9bc78155ecb550", "ja": "（こんな麗花も、公演本番では最高の切なさを表現\nしてくれた。ピッくんの件のせいかもしれないが……）", "zh": "（这样的丽花，在正式公演时也表现出了最棒的悲伤。也许是因为小皮的事……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1005_se", "source_sha256": "b12709ece634544d32af67a926a9d0555729b694be2ce9963a7d8ef771034632", "ja": "プルルルル……", "zh": "嘟噜噜噜噜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "27acef40d8bb6383b15c7cab3c9e1a230e83dcd77a8c374eaa9e85bc35696a15", "ja": "おっと、電話が……。\nあれ？　あずささんからだ……はい、もしもし？", "zh": "哎呀，电话来了……\n咦？是梓小姐打来的……喂，你好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "975e4c31e535ebb5c3261facd8c9ca42b1e62ea221b43d6d3d5e3faf27b66a43", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん、\nお疲れさまです～、あずさです～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，\n辛苦啦～我是梓～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ea76b3ed6ea4989830e82fb7e331367e1033b8ff6dbcaa129b0df56d5f54a79c", "ja": "お疲れさまです、どうしました？　あずささん。", "zh": "辛苦了，怎么了？あずさ小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1009_010azu", "source_sha256": "c988cf7c45bde02241dc29073cd2ec99c758a92b2d14d00dc3bfa15e89779f00", "ja": "あの～。じつは今、公演前に麗花ちゃんが話して\nくれた山に、来ているんですけれど……。", "zh": "那个～，其实我现在来到了公演前\n丽花提过的那座山上……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "498ea84717167e34ef96ed4d3907922891dbac416cb71ce8d1b805c5e05d63b3", "ja": "帰り道が、わからなくなってしまったみたいで～。", "zh": "我好像，不知道该怎么回去了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6a9646ffc8e01b313ab15b5364e4bfe0c8f4e61d9be7205f2130f14861959509", "ja": "うわあっ、大変じゃないですか！？　わかりました、\nすぐ行きますから、そこを動かないでくださいね！", "zh": "哇啊，那不是很糟糕吗！？我知道了，\n马上就过去，请千万待在原地别动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "03f9c6d8df908985b020118a4a3511271f484ad23cf0d61c1d1b60af0f887980", "ja": "ごめんなさい……。見晴らしがとってもいいですから、\nきっと頂上にいるんだって思います～。", "zh": "对不起……因为这里视野特别好，\n我想一定是在山顶上～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "83a9e19d076917c38b75c6fa1e87f2091cbf90a814e602975116b361f12b5167", "ja": "とってもお空が広くて、空気もキレイで、\nすがすがしいです。……ヤッホー♪", "zh": "天空特别开阔，空气也很清新，感觉真是神清气爽。……喂——♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "db714a3504a7cddbbf71ad8e382348ef61a4e9e6f36f70db3ace235bca343515", "ja": "あ、そうそう！　それで{$P$}さん、\n麗花ちゃんに伝えてほしいんですけれど……", "zh": "啊，对了！还有，关于{$P$}先生，想请你转告给丽花，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1015_se", "source_sha256": "74a7d8f4383c756feb4da2c31c0f046bdef1a032b6c34b0025cb86772a174136", "ja": "プツッ", "zh": "咔嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bbca9b3b0ef5497e54b46513b0d184c192683fbc8a206a8ab467643e346a6e2b", "ja": "あずささん？　もしもし？　もしもし！？\n……ダメだ、つながらない！", "zh": "阿梓莎小姐？喂？喂——！？\n……不行，联系不上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "1afb43994c0994f2df498c16778c3b149eb4ae037ea84db3fc3538f0181b1af8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、あずささんって、\nもしかして……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，梓小姐该不会……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1018_p", "source_sha256": "7a4a4afc70bb32c0a05d5f319ad169d4978ce4cf9703e97c5a61ccd179282ea4", "ja": "ああ、麗花が前に言っていた山で、道に迷っちゃった\nみたいで……。とにかく、今から迎えに行ってくる。", "zh": "啊，好像在丽花之前提到的那座山里迷路了……总之，我现在就去接她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "387084635f3d00dcaf00509a076e8144588d139e3bec017cc608195accc5d1d2", "ja": "それなら、私も行って先導します！\n何度も登ってる山ですから、その方がいいかなって。", "zh": "既然这样，我也一起去带路！\n那座山我已经爬过很多次了，我觉得这样比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "42a238c954e20c3662ab78837637cbd464ac7d924c6177817ee76b4e3357015a", "ja": "それもそうか……。\n助かるよ、麗花。頼む！", "zh": "这么说也对……。\n那就拜托你了，丽花！佑劳了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "161058cd7b4b2a227dc41a8cd56d1759836c5adf0ab5eae9b8e160375b86d76c", "ja": "あの……{$P$}、私たちも！\n人手は多い方がいいですよね？", "zh": "那个……{$P$}，我们也来！\n人手多一点总比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1022_050jul", "source_sha256": "6678dd815a9cbea206509834f37ef90c763831d6bd1fede06568c2ef48f1ce76", "ja": "いろいろ準備も必要だろ。\n何でも言ってくれ！", "zh": "也需要做各种准备吧。\n尽管开口！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1023_p", "source_sha256": "6557c5d82315ff2c0dce451fb431031215a613b38e85b7fdf9f472779c2e099c", "ja": "……わかった。みんなで行こう！\nただし、焦らないよう、気をつけて行こうな！", "zh": "……明白了。大家一起去吧！\n不过，可别太心急，一路上要小心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1024_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1025_p", "source_sha256": "c09362b7627835bcc05b61b3ee8746db29fde3baefd1e5eb7f9a0bfc30c86ce3", "ja": "（そろそろ、頂上付近のはずだけど……おやっ！？）", "zh": "（差不多该到山顶附近了才对……哎！？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1026_inu", "source_sha256": "9bddf6512b74f87dcf736a3035280b619e929aa22b583532ebc2d2858d41af82", "ja": "わんっ、わんっ！", "zh": "汪、汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1027_p", "source_sha256": "c0da97cecf7bff8f7692a87b799fed2a34a0a26bee0d42e9e5d108852177b8bf", "ja": "な、なんて可愛いワンちゃんだ！\nおお、よしよし……、ん？　この犬は……？", "zh": "这、这狗狗也太可爱了吧！\n哦哦，乖乖……嗯？这只狗是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1028_010azu", "source_sha256": "58a5869edd9017c4c7de20710a2165e3031cd70eef4427a2647592842e6742b2", "ja": "{$P$}さん！\nそれに、みんなも……わざわざ、本当にすみません～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生！\n而且大家也……特地赶过来，真的非常抱歉～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "564657e58c213d1fae6c4d26a81652af668df10dc69b385683b52dce659ccca1", "ja": "あずささん！！　よかった……よかったぁ～！！", "zh": "梓姐！！太好了……太好了——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1030_050jul", "source_sha256": "2749eee2ecea761dfb3df2be967312e672bffeafbd8beeb18fe72db9a8547a54", "ja": "ふう～。さすがにヒヤヒヤしたぜ、あず姉。\n山で迷子はシャレにならないだろ！", "zh": "呼——真是让人捏了把汗啊，梓姐。\n在山里迷路可不是闹着玩的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "3b79bbe58ae1b08cef4e562850748d33228004d697659edf880f9eb1a22a34c6", "ja": "でも、頂上でじっとしていてもらえてよかった♪\n大丈夫ですか？　どこも痛くないですか？", "zh": "不过，能请你在山顶乖乖待着，真是太好了♪\n没事吧？身上没有哪里疼吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1032_010azu", "source_sha256": "7056471f2348b73a3247aca29f6dfa7cc6ba0ac59b6a48cd342fe987295fd826", "ja": "大丈夫よ、麗花ちゃん。\nみんな、心配かけて、本当にごめんなさい……。", "zh": "我没事哦，丽花。\n让大家担心了，真的很对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1033_p", "source_sha256": "8f4871783ab3f276b4871d73c92ff7b20d6262676fc8ae075e8cd8a18fd6ae08", "ja": "いいえ、大ごとにならなくて良かったです。\nこの犬は、あずささんのですよね？", "zh": "不，没闹出大事就好。\n这只狗是あずさ小姐的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1034_010azu", "source_sha256": "4b726d0b7898180cafa1c0718f911863d55af1693575a516acf2dde154a08727", "ja": "はい、とらたんです♪\nこの子が、みんなを見付けてくれたんですよ～。", "zh": "是小虎♪  \n这孩子帮忙找到了大家哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1035_toratan", "source_sha256": "041f4a60b728b63784f47d3aa79c5ab39ac0bbff0131bf435e7ddbee127d809a", "ja": "わんわんっ！　ハッハッ……。", "zh": "汪汪！　哈、哈……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1036_027say", "source_sha256": "8f3f02b35bd815f395b363b2e4fb61c01928fb268bd8f623a1853533dfe69388", "ja": "カワイイ……♪　とらたん、えらかったね！\nあずささんを守ってくれて、ありがとう！", "zh": "好可爱……♪ 虎太郎，真乖！\n谢谢你保护了梓小姐！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1037_toratan", "source_sha256": "d59890c5ed4a61d0afcb5d2ab11f9c74fa28702e24d65dc8bb4c105190f703f8", "ja": "わん！", "zh": "汪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "b58af759d295847396963b41281f06d8e10a85001649a3abf838cee4f90401c8", "ja": "にしても……あず姉、なんでいきなり登山なんだ？\n紅葉でも見たくなったのか？", "zh": "不过话说回来……梓姐，怎么突然要去爬山啊？\n是想去看看红叶了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1039_010azu", "source_sha256": "32fa1d6ecacc02134d6430b40f86c9a629bbe9b5445acf18e6562adf41842923", "ja": "あ、そうそう！\nええっと……麗花ちゃん、これをどうぞ～♪", "zh": "啊，对了对了！\n那个……丽花，这个给你～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "c4b79f80c2384c4e60ee148ba8c61e898aa8e8d45b56c652ab3b43d7e46c6e0e", "ja": "え……あ、あああー！！！\nそのピッケルは……ピッくん！！！", "zh": "诶……啊、啊啊啊——！！！\n那把冰镐是……小冰镐！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1041_027say", "source_sha256": "236422b579b81ec7ca4412a47313fcc87320d448217a22675add3f2947543bc2", "ja": "えええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "236422b579b81ec7ca4412a47313fcc87320d448217a22675add3f2947543bc2", "ja": "えええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1043_p", "source_sha256": "7cc3420ef69080933a8a55af36e5ff052e485272406c6556d100432cbf101d1c", "ja": "ピッくんって……。まさか、\nあずささん、それを探しに……？", "zh": "皮克……难道说，梓小姐是去找那个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1044_010azu", "source_sha256": "a6537aeb8bc1da912003cc5dfc11ad431a5663632f8a2755684d8e7b00adf5b5", "ja": "はい～。というか、もしかしたらと思って、この子に\n麗花ちゃんのハンカチの匂いを嗅がせてみたら……。", "zh": "是呀～我想着说不定能行，就让这孩子闻了闻丽花的手帕，然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1045_010azu", "source_sha256": "d8bb3105ec0e029ee3ad0deac20fe0db8eb5fe12724fb49d48df963403665e78", "ja": "ここまで連れてきてくれたんです～♪", "zh": "是它把我带到这里来的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1046_050jul", "source_sha256": "a55e9c118c497298c51baafb3ae33d76755a709b631d0faa651b27b13d65a19f", "ja": "マジか……！\n最近の犬は、そんなに優秀なのか……！", "zh": "真的吗……！\n现在的狗都这么厉害吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1047_048rei", "source_sha256": "1189d2a847d04a55f77f5268ce32d0bea887bb3141489a90a1eb42f224e70bdf", "ja": "ピッくん、ピッくん……！\nうう、また会えると思ってなかったよぉ！", "zh": "皮君、皮君……！\n呜呜，没想到还能再见到你呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1048_048rei", "source_sha256": "075eb6778b99fd4fd761091f756eb66606d797b23de13f888c52157bbe3f2151", "ja": "うう、ずっと一緒だよ、離れないよ、\n絶対だよ。ピッくん……！", "zh": "呜呜，我们要一直在一起，再也不分开了，\n绝对哦。小皮……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1049_027say", "source_sha256": "a47c7277412729987cc9fcb295b5deb7663e94dff0eb4f3ba4dcb1326ac84168", "ja": "麗花さん……あんなに泣いちゃうなんて……。\nよかったね、ジュリア！　ぐすっ……。", "zh": "丽花小姐……居然哭得那么厉害……太好了，茱莉亚！呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1050_050jul", "source_sha256": "148ece6eb76f8f45b37666744fd85752f46f6a4fd4e7ae34c73e692d2a5cd849", "ja": "そ、そうだな……。なんか、いろいろ気になるけど……\nまあ、いいか！　ぐすっ。", "zh": "是、是啊……总觉得有些地方让人在意，不过……嘛，也就这样吧！呜咽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0108_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0108_story_07_1051_p", "source_sha256": "5379b51f06f074dd214fd99bd551876f6e43c0d8267177ffd75f42d96accaf9b", "ja": "（こうして、ピッくんの待ちぼうけは、\n終わったのだった……本当によかったな、麗花！）", "zh": "（就这样，小哔的苦等结束了……真的太好了，丽花！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
